    "title": "Annual St. Paul Lutheran BBQ and Auction Set for Feb. 1 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Contributed Article ,\n7 hours ago St. Paul Lutheran Church and School invites the community to its annual BBQ Dinner and Live Auction Fundraiser on Sunday, February 1, at the Thorndale Fireman’s Hall.\nEnjoy a hearty BBQ meal featuring brisket with BBQ sauce, noodles, pinto beans, potato salad, pickles, onions, and bread. Plates are $15 and will be served from 11 a.m. to 1 p.m., with dine-in or to-go options available. No advance tickets are required.\nSenior citizen local delivery is available by calling 512-924-0151 in advance. Desserts will be offered for a free-will donation, and the live auction begins at 12:30 p.m.\nMark your calendar and bring family and friends for great food and fellowship in support of St. Paul Lutheran Church and School.\nFor more information, contact Tammy Pickett at 512-269-3598 or Teresa Ging at (512) 924-0151.",
